         <head>MEMOIRS OF LOUIS XV. &amp; XVI.</head>
         <author>By Hausset and Princess Lamballe</author>
         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>Quotes and Images From Memoirs of Louis XV. and XVI.</head>
